<node id="obs_1">
  <data key="d28">ObservationClaim</data>
  <data key="d29">CIP and Fermi-level GCE-DFT approaches are equivalent for metallic electrodes and inner-sphere reactions, while CIP can also be applied to outer-sphere and biased two-electrode systems.</data>
  <data key="d38">computational_method_comparison</data>
  <data key="d39">CIP and Fermi-level GCE-DFT approaches are equivalent for metallic electrodes and inner-sphere reactions, while CIP can also be applied to outer-sphere and biased two-electrode systems.</data>
  <data key="d40">computational</data>
  <data key="d30">The abstract reports numerical and analytical studies demonstrating equivalence in the former cases and broader applicability of CIP in the latter cases.</data>
  <data key="d31">["obs_1"]</data>
